 },
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "You'd never pay someone to sit in your car.",
   "rate": "+14%",
   "pitch": "-5Hz",
   "gap": 0.1,
   "volume": "+10%"
  },
  {
   "text": "This guy owes four thousand rupees for it.",
   "rate": "+8%",
   "pitch": "-7Hz",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "Rewind one year.",
   "rate": "+4%",
   "pitch": "-6Hz",
   "gap": 0.18
  },
  {
   "text": "Arjun drives. Priya, Rohan and Sharma ji ride along.",
   "rate": "+26%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Petrol gets split every Friday, on whatever's in the glovebox.",
   "rate": "+28%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Week one. One napkin. Rohan owes two hundred. Clean.",
   "rate": "+30%",
   "pitch": "+2Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Month two. Tolls, parking, and Sharma ji's samosas.",
   "rate": "+30%",
   "pitch": "+3Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Month six. The glovebox physically will not close.",
   "rate": "+24%",
   "pitch": "-3Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "So Arjun, the engineer, builds a spreadsheet.",
   "rate": "+24%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Twelve tabs. Colour coded. A formula for samosas.",
   "rate": "+32%",
   "pitch": "+4Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "One error. Nobody opens it again.",
   "rate": "+16%",
   "pitch": "-6Hz",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Back to napkins. Except now Sharma ji does the maths.",
   "rate": "+24%",
   "pitch": "+2Hz",
   "gap": 0.18
  },
  {
   "text": "Which brings us to today.",
   "rate": "+12%",
   "pitch": "-4Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "The final napkin says Arjun owes Sharma ji four thousand.",
   "rate": "+14%",
   "pitch": "-6Hz",
   "gap": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "For driving him. In Arjun's own car.",
   "rate": "+6%",
   "pitch": "-8Hz",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "text": "Moral: a carpool survives traffic. It doesn't survive napkin maths.",
   "rate": "+12%",
   "pitch": "-6Hz",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "text": "So the four moved the money into an app.",
   "rate": "+22%",
   "pitch": "+4Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Every petrol bill goes into settle costs. The app splits it.",
   "rate": "+26%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "The roster rotates the driving too, so Arjun gets mornings off.",
   "rate": "+26%",
   "pitch": "+2Hz",
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "And the glovebox? It closes now.",
   "rate": "+16%",
   "pitch": "-3Hz",
   "gap": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Sharma ji still pays in samosas. Now the guard gets one too.",
   "rate": "+22%",
   "pitch": "+6Hz",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "If your carpool still runs on napkins, Sahyatri does the maths.",
   "rate": "+18%",
   "pitch": "-2Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Link in bio.",
   "rate": "+10%",
   "pitch": "+0Hz",
   "gap": 0.1
  }
 ],
